{
  "source": "Prompts/work-with-ai-opener-v12.mp4",
  "duration": 117.568,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.44,
      "text": "You've seen the tools' capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.32,
      "end": 6.14,
      "text": "Now we shift our focus to the practical mechanics of how you actually operate it."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.58,
      "end": 9.34,
      "text": "Here is the reality most people miss."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.04,
      "end": 14.74,
      "text": "Two people can use the exact same AI system and walk away with completely different outputs."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.54,
      "end": 16.16,
      "text": "Think of it like photography."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.12,
      "end": 19.44,
      "text": "Imagine two people holding identical phone cameras,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.76,
      "end": 21.56,
      "text": "pointing them at the exact same sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.16,
      "end": 24.3,
      "text": "One person snaps a rushed blurry picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.8,
      "end": 27.54,
      "text": "The other person captures a carefully framed crisp shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.54,
      "end": 29.78,
      "text": "The hardware in their hands never changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.48,
      "end": 32.24,
      "text": "The same principle applies to AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.02,
      "end": 36.56,
      "text": "Mastering the mechanics of the tool is what turns a confusing response"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.56,
      "end": 38.64,
      "text": "into a sharp, professional result."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.92,
      "end": 42.98,
      "text": "To build those mechanics, we use a three-part roadmap."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.8,
      "end": 45.28,
      "text": "Let's look at the plan for this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.02,
      "end": 47.9,
      "text": "Step one is knowing what it's for."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.5,
      "end": 52.66,
      "text": "This involves understanding how AI operates differently from traditional software"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.66,
      "end": 55.26,
      "text": "that follows a strict, predictable set of rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.26,
      "end": 59.06,
      "text": "You need to identify the specific types of work and logic"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.06,
      "end": 61.36,
      "text": "that these models are naturally built to handle."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.94,
      "end": 65.06,
      "text": "From there, you choose the correct application for your specific task"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.06,
      "end": 68.06,
      "text": "and commit to learning how its specific interface works."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.98,
      "end": 70.26,
      "text": "Second, use it well."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.12,
      "end": 73.44,
      "text": "We will practice giving the model specific details"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.44,
      "end": 75.48,
      "text": "to steer it toward a better answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.48,
      "end": 78.08,
      "text": "and look at how the software actually reads your prompts."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.84,
      "end": 81.1,
      "text": "Third, think before you trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.68,
      "end": 84.74,
      "text": "This is the crucial final phase of handling the model's output."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.74,
      "end": 89.08,
      "text": "Because models generate plausible, but sometimes incorrect information,"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.56,
      "end": 92.32,
      "text": "you must actively verify claims against credible sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.12,
      "end": 94.68,
      "text": "The software proposes an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.34,
      "end": 99.12,
      "text": "You remain the final judge of whether that work is accurate and ready to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.2,
      "end": 103.84,
      "text": "The quality of your final result depends directly on how deliberately"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.84,
      "end": 105.36,
      "text": "you apply these three steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.88,
      "end": 109.4,
      "text": "Don't just use AI. Work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.34,
      "end": 113.28,
      "text": "AI doesn't replace your thinking. It multiplies it."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.28,
      "end": 113.68,
      "text": "."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.68,
      "end": 113.82,
      "text": "."
    }
  ],
